<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34059" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβρόντ-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thunderstruck, stupefied,
				stupid</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ποιεῖν τινά</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.4.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦμβρόντητε σύ</span> thou
				<i>gaping fool</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				793
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγένετ᾽ ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				233.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠλιθίους καὶ ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				2.140c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Pk.</u>
				273
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβρόντητε, εἶτα νῦν
			λέγεις</span>; <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.243
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later of
			ideas, <i>crack-brained, mad</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. καὶ πεπλανημένον σόφισμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Chr.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβρόντητα δὲ πάντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					47
				</span></i>
			.</div>
